# Story page: clockwork
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Clockwork Citadel
---
Everything in the citadel moved on the beat, and the beat never stopped.

Spikes rose and fell beneath {name} like the teeth of a great slow machine, and {name} learned to count them, one, two, three, now.

In the clock tower a brass hand pointed at a notice board covered in contracts: tasks for hire, paid in gold. {name} had never had a job before. It found it liked having something to finish.
